---
---

<header class="relative pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden border-b border-zinc-900">
  <!-- Subtle background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-7xl h-96 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800/20 via-transparent to-transparent blur-3xl -z-10 pointer-events-none" />

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Status Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300 mb-8">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Autonomous Agent Workflows & Local Data Pipelines</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title & Headline -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white max-w-4xl leading-[1.1]">
      Tomás Cáceres
      <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-zinc-400 mt-3 font-mono">
        Machine Learning & Data Science Engineer
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Core Pitch -->
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
      Diseño y construyo sistemas de <span class="text-zinc-200 font-medium">datos orientados a privacidad (Local-First)</span>, 
      orquestación de <span class="text-zinc-200 font-medium">agentes autónomos de IA</span> y 
      pipelines predictivos de alto rendimiento. Especializado en el puente entre modelos estadísticos/ML y 
      software de ingeniería robusto con bajo consumo de recursos.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs and quick tech tags -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#case-study"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-900 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-white/10 transition-all duration-200"
      >
        <span>Ver Caso de Estudio: ActivityUI</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
        </svg>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://github.com/TomasCaceresIO"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-800 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-zinc-800 hover:text-white transition-all duration-200 font-mono"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>GitHub @TomasCaceresIO</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="mailto:tomas14caceres@gmail.com"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 text-sm font-mono transition-colors"
      >
        <span>tomas14caceres@gmail.com</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Metric quick ribbon -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-900/80">
      <div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-mono">Local-First</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Zero Telemetry Leaks</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-mono">&lt; 35 MB</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Rust Memory Footprint</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-mono">Agentic</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Multi-Agent Pipelines</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-mono">Time-Series</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">ML Clustering Ready</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
